   * Related operations:
   * - GET /profile/{memberId}: View any member's profile (public information)
   * - GET /profile: View own profile with edit capability
   *
   * The operation returns the complete updated member object on success, reflecting all changes made.
   *
   * @param connection
   * @param body Profile update data containing the new display name and optional bio text. Display name is required and must not be empty. Bio is optional and can be cleared by setting to null or empty string.
